OpenPlate reads record metadata published by The Metropolitan Museum of Art and
The Cleveland Museum of Art, and creator life dates from Wikidata. It is not
affiliated with or endorsed by either museum. The licences covering those records
and images belong to their respective institutions; see:

- The Metropolitan Museum of Art terms:
  https://www.metmuseum.org/information/terms-and-conditions
- The Cleveland Museum of Art Open Access:
  https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access
- Wikidata: https://wikidata.org/ (CC0)

This software reports what those institutions publish. It performs no legal
analysis and is not legal advice.